---
import { IMAGES, img } from "../data/images";
---

<section id="manifesto" class="manifesto" data-bg-light>
  <div class="manifesto-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow manifesto-eyebrow" data-reveal>The Idea</p>

    <p class="manifesto-statement" data-reveal>
      Atlanta began as a <em>terminus</em>, the last stop on the Western
      &amp; Atlantic line, the point where rail met road and a city grew up
      around the crossing. We kept the word for the same reason the city
      did: it's where different work arrives at the same table.
    </p>

    <div class="manifesto-grid">
      <figure class="manifesto-figure" data-reveal>
        <img
          src={img(IMAGES.manifestoBrick, 900, 1100)}
          alt="A wooden work table set against an original exposed-brick wall inside the Terminus building."
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption class="eyebrow">Fig. 01: Original brick, Concourse level</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="manifesto-copy" data-reveal>
        <p>
          No two members here are headed the same place. A film editor two
          desks from a bond attorney, a product team subletting a Studio
          from a muralist. Terminus doesn't try to make that make sense.
          It just gives it a good room, strong coffee, and a door that
          locks when you need it to.
        </p>
        <p>
          The building has done this before. Built in 1921 as a freight
          depot for the line that gave Atlanta its start, it spent decades
          moving goods through downtown before it sat empty. We restored
          the brick, kept the steel trusses, and put desks where the
          platforms used to be.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto {
    background: var(--color-bone);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    padding: clamp(5rem, 12vw, 9rem) clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .manifesto-inner {
    max-width: 68rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .manifesto-eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-clay);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .manifesto-statement {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4.4vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height: 1.18;
    font-weight: 400;
    max-width: 52rem;
    margin: 0 0 clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5.5rem);
  }
  .manifesto-statement em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-clay);
  }

  .manifesto-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .manifesto-figure img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .manifesto-figure figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-steel);
  }

  .manifesto-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ink) 78%, transparent);
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .manifesto-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }
</style>
